Package: compiz-plugin-staticdock
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         compiz-core (>= 1:0.9.14)
Description: Compiz plugin to keep dock/panel windows static during transforms
 staticdock keeps panel and dock windows visually fixed, undistorted, and
 at full opacity while the cube, rotate, or expo plugins transform the
 desktop - instead of letting them shrink, rotate, or fade away along
 with everything else.
